Package: droiddeck-gnome-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: required
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DroidDeck <maxjividen@gmail.com>
Depends: gnome-shell, mutter, mutter-dev-bin, gnome-session-bin, ibus, gir1.2-ibus-1.0,
 python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, pipewire, wireplumber, dbus-x11, fonts-noto-cjk
Description: DroidDeck GNOME desktop and Android input bridge
 Runs GNOME Shell nested in DroidDeck's compositor without root or logind and
 carries Android keyboard text to the focused application.
